      "text": "That sheer volcanic rock rising straight out of the ocean leaves zero room for error. Seeing Mount Scenery perpetually shrouded in cloud mist really drives home how isolated and wild this island's terrain actually is. It is mind-blowing to witness a Caribbean island with virtually no sandy beaches, just raw vertical cliffs!",
